Suddenly, large drops of water fall.
A very heavy rain begins.
This is my first rain in Mumbai.
I smile happily.
I had read on the app in the morning, "It will rain in the evening."
That forecast was exactly right!
But now the rain is very heavy.
I quickly go towards a shop.
There is a large awning outside the shop.
I stand there for shelter.
Other people are standing there with me too.
An older woman looks at me and smiles.
She says, "Look outside, how it is raining!"
I say, "Yes, the weather is nice and cool now."
After a short while, the heavy rain stops.
Now only light rain is falling.
I walk to the bus stop.
My BEST bus arrives and I climb inside.
I sit near the window and go home looking outside.
